                                "sense_id": "e1e8fbf5-5a09-375b-ad97-0b735b65e6ad",
                                "text": "1817, Samuel Taylor Coleridge, Biographia Literaria\nThis remark, so ludicrously inapposite to, or rather, incongruous with, the purpose, for which I was known to have visited Birmingham, ... produced an involuntary and general burst of laughter;"
                            },
